# AMD64 thunk export spec -- mscoree.dll.
#
# From the 2026-08-17 corpus pass.  Styx: Master of Shadows imports this
# module STATICALLY -- one export, _CorExeMain -- and it had no guest thunk,
# so the loader refused the native ppc64 module (c000007b) and the whole image
# failed to load (c0000135).  A native UE3 game importing the CLR entry point
# is an artefact of its build, not a sign it runs managed code; what matters
# here is only that the import must BIND for the image to start.
#
# 2 of 48 eligible exports are emitted.  _CorExeMain is not one of them: no
# Wine header declares it, so it keeps its ordinal as a named sentinel and a
# guest that CALLS it faults by name.  Styx does not call it -- the import
# exists because the linker put it there.
DLL mscoree.dll
FROM-SPEC auto
